":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-3677](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-3677)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nTaking backup on  SQL schema with 70k tables fails  due to high memory usage consumption PostgreSQL backend causing OOM.\r\n\r\nFrom memory context dumps reported,  caching of the catalog is highest memory consumer this which is expected. Though ideally we should confirm if the memory usage  is expected or extra bloat due to memory not being freed at regular granularity . We should compare with PG for this scenario. \r\n\r\n CacheMemoryContext: 13098593184 total in 110291 blocks; 11812152 free (48599 chunks); 13086781032 used\r\n \r\n\r\n```\r\nTopMemoryContext: 401416 total in 8 blocks; 5240 free (6 chunks); 396176 used\r\n  Operator class cache: 8192 total in 1 blocks; 552 free (0 chunks); 7640 used\r\n  pgstat TabStatusArray lookup hash table: 8192 total in 1 blocks; 1448 free (0 chunks); 6744 used\r\n  TopTransactionContext: 14204283224 total in 91193 blocks; 7188544 free (452 chunks); 14197094680 used\r\n  TransactionAbortContext: 32768 total in 1 blocks; 32504 free (0 chunks); 264 used\r\n  Portal hash: 8192 total in 1 blocks; 552 free (0 chunks); 7640 used\r\n  TopPortalContext: 8192 total in 1 blocks; 7928 free (0 chunks); 264 used\r\n  Relcache by OID: 8388608 total in 11 blocks; 808616 free (27 chunks); 7579992 used\r\n  CacheMemoryContext: 13098593184 total in 110291 blocks; 11812152 free (48599 chunks); 13086781032 used\r\n\r\n.........................\r\n.........................\r\n.........................\r\n.........................\r\n\r\n  ErrorContext: 8192 total in 1 blocks; 7928 free (6 chunks); 264 used\r\nGrand total: 31643573792 bytes in 936273 blocks; 220954368 free (53052 chunks); 31422619424 used\r\n\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes